29a9be-0ff2-4194-85c2-a9c88cbfa244-styles-1c9d2c07-3467-41a8-a0d5-e24e7bd1cae5-attributes-textshadow:undefined;--replo-library-7229a9be-0ff2-4194-85c2-a9c88cbfa244-styles-1c9d2c07-3467-41a8-a0d5-e24e7bd1cae5-attributes-textstroke:undefined;--replo-library-7229a9be-0ff2-4194-85c2-a9c88cbfa244-styles-1c9d2c07-3467-41a8-a0d5-e24e7bd1cae5-attributes-letterspacing:undefined;--replo-library-7229a9be-0ff2-4194-85c2-a9c88cbfa244-styles-1c9d2c07-3467-41a8-a0d5-e24e7bd1cae5-attributes-texttransform:undefined"><span style="width:100%"><p>3. Pills Have Terrible Absorption (Your Body Only Uses 30%)</p></span></div><div data-rid="04279597-7ec9-4863-893e-9331b4f4ee91" class="r-yllyx5 alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Here's a frustrating truth: Your body only absorbs about 30% of nutrients from typical pills. The rest? Expensive waste.</p><p><br></p><p>Even worse, many supplements use cheap, poorly absorbed forms of nutrients. That magnesium oxide in your cabinet? Your body can barely use it. The synthetic vitamins? Often unrecognised by your cells.</p><p><br></p><p>monthlies uses only premium bioavailable nutrients that can absorb up to 300% better than pills. Plus, as a powder mixed in water, it doesn't have to break down like tablets - the nutrients are immediately available to your body.</p></span></div><picture data-rid="8c33113d-f425-409b-b5f3-1b8955fa98bc" class="r-vnxh8b"><source srcSet="https://assets.replocdn.com/projects/05d1c41a-8cc0-4d37-87de-b42dfbdbefe9/7fba67c0-2c88-4ada-81fb-08b7839597a7?width=820" media="(max-width: 640px)"/><source srcSet="https://assets.replocdn.com/projects/74ef5866-9ad7-456b-81d4-5e84e591ae16/7794eb63-42ea-4ab3-b93c-40ed7455e5da?width=1024" media="(min-width: 641px) and (max-width: 1024px)"/><source srcSet="https://assets.replocdn.com/projects/74ef5866-9ad7-456b-81d4-5e84e591ae16/7794eb63-42ea-4ab3-b93c-40ed7455e5da?width=1800" media="(min-width: 1025px) and (max-width: 2400px)"/><img src="https://assets.replocdn.com/projects/74ef5866-